{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6ee667926ea7db6105d47b0603acb684d56bcafb775460758d176960d6783731",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_b:2_4_010_02_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b835677ae4a201a8c682a250771e5c80263e1b89005148a40f55b2ec64806c07",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー！\n辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_b:2_4_010_02_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:feb00e97ce6bd020c935ccf26925acca4894b42d8512355ccaedad49850b5d5d",
      "text": "现在，嘴巴里，波子汽水糖滋滋滋的！好有趣！\n制作人，也要吃吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_b:2_4_010_02_09_b:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f25e7cb187a3f6382c5309621528e45916eece6ad5f425fbf209f67c818134e",
      "text": "我想吃！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_b:2_4_010_02_09_b:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e330282aeb12f365deafa5d716de1972159df570e85d4c84c946c177b9f4664f",
      "text": "买了波子汽水糖\n呀！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_b:2_4_010_02_09_b:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3289ee0915333b424877be62e0dbea591279adb9bf55217be4bba87faa8eaf6b",
      "text": "汽水糖，附带了《激斗！超越界限》的贴纸。\n和大家一起买的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_b:2_4_010_02_09_b:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e141e52170cbad13f3190e110eac7018e48ce7619035b4eb06ce4289a92f00e3",
      "text": "我，抽到了朱音的贴纸！我演的角色，\n好高兴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_b:2_4_010_02_09_b:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:821377494a42c91d3f6f81aa24dec9162c578f5e787b9c2dac965762accfba69",
      "text": "龙，没有抽到创真。\n但是，恭二抽到了，送给龙了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_b:2_4_010_02_09_b:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:882d4d207fd1e4027fc74c3e669aabf7418379ba107cf658b2c9333b809c21f6",
      "text": "龙，很高兴！露出了，幸福微笑哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_b:2_4_010_02_09_b:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3a9d534b81e2ac4c7ba6fec1a115d6d2a90ba4da035a5ccca039cc6079b2271",
      "text": "这个贴纸，是护身符。拍摄，\n也约定好了大家要一起努力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_b:2_4_010_02_09_b:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbd5b0d1035095b5870f77563c82d43c77bf368578f62e79f44398b3c639c1e9",
      "text": "汽水糖，带去事务所！\n制作人，抽到了谁，要告诉我哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
